      <h1>Social Studies Education</h1>
      <h2>Initial licensure program</h2>
      <p>The University of Minnesota's social studies education initial licensure program will empower you to become an inquiring, analytical, and engaging professional educator who can help all students to succeed in school. The program seeks to develop thoughtful practitioners who are enthusiastic about and prepared for leadership roles in schools.</p>
